# NAME: MCP
# UPDATED: 2026-07-15 00:00:00
# 通用远程 MCP host (Claude Code / Codex / Gemini 共用) — 自包含, 不依赖 AI.list
# 约定: 单 host 用 DOMAIN 精确 (不误伤厂商 production API); 多子域共享 MCP 专用父域时用 DOMAIN-SUFFIX

# > Figma
DOMAIN,mcp.figma.com

# > Notion
DOMAIN,mcp.notion.com

# > Linear
DOMAIN,mcp.linear.app

# > Sentry
DOMAIN,mcp.sentry.dev

# > Mixpanel
DOMAIN,mcp.mixpanel.com

# > Context7
DOMAIN,mcp.context7.com

# > Grep
DOMAIN,mcp.grep.app

